          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakambila Mose ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elela Alona ne bana bandi balume mukenji ne, Eu udi mukenji wa mulambu wa kuosha ha kahia, mulambu wa kuosha newikale ha nkunyi ha tshioshelu butuku buonso tô ne dinda, kahia nekikalehu butuku buonso, kakajimi nansha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muakuidi nealuate bilulu biandi bia lin ne mihanu ya lin, neangate butue bua kahia kakosha mulambu wa ha tshioshelu, neabuteke hehi ne tshioshelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neavule bilulu ebi, nealuate bilulu bikuabo, neatuale butue ku butshika bua tshitudilu ku muaba mutoke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kahia ka ha tshioshelu kakajimi nansha, muakuidi neatekehu nkunyi dinda ne dinda, nealonge mulambu wa kuosha ha tshioshelu, neoshe dianyi dia mulambu wa kuvuisha nʼau ditalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kahia katemene ha tshioshelu ku dituku ne ku dituku, kakajimi nansha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eu udi mukenji wa mulambu wa bukula bana balume ba Alona nebaufile ku mesu kua Yehowa ku mpala kua tshioshelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye neambule dianza dia bukula bubotesha tente budi busangisha ne manyi ne musenga wa manananshi, neabuoshe ha tshioshelu bu tshintu tshidi tshima dihembu, bu tshivulukidi kudi Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshituha tshidi tshishale netshikale kudi Alona ne bana bandi balume bu tshintu tshia kudia, bobo nebadie tshituha tshidi katshiyi ne luevene mu muaba wa tshijila, mu luhangu lua ntenta wa kusambakena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabalambi tshituha atshi ne luevene. Nakabaha tshituha tshia mulambu wanyi wa kuosha ha kahia, tshintu tshidi tshitambe tshijila bu mulambu wa kubuikila nʼau bubi bua bantu ne mulambu wa disambuka dia mikenji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bana balume ba Alona bonso nebatshidie, bu tshituha tshiabo mu bikondo biabo bionso munkatshi mua mulambu ya kuoshila Yehowa ha kahia, muntu yonso udi ulenga bintu ebi tshianza neikale muntu wa tshijila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
